{%- doc -%}
  Outputs 'true' when a product is one of the in-studio services rather than something
  the studio actually sells, so it can be kept out of search results.

  A product counts as a service when any of these hold:
  - it carries the `service` tag
  - its product type is `Service`
  - its title matches one of the service pages linked from the piercing and tattoo
    services grids (templates/page.piercing-services.json,
    templates/page.tattoo-services.json)

  Titles are compared loosely: lowercased, `&` read as `and`, and hyphens read as
  spaces, so "Dotwork & Mandala Tattoos" matches a product named
  "Dotwork and Mandala Tattoos".

  @param {object} product - the product to test

  @example
  {% capture is_service %}{% render 'pi-is-service-product', product: product %}{% endcapture %}
  {% assign is_service = is_service | strip %}
  {% if is_service == 'true' %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- assign service_titles =
  '|blackwork|conch piercing|dotwork and mandala tattoos|earlobe piercing|eyebrow piercing|'
  | append: 'fine line tattoos|geometric tattoos|helix piercing|horror tattoos|industrial piercing|'
  | append: 'micro realistic tattoos|minimalist tattoos|monroe piercing|navel piercing|'
  | append: 'nostril piercing|realistic tattoos|script and lettering tattoos|septum piercing|'
  | append: 'snake bite piercing|tongue piercing|traditional tattoos|tragus piercing|'
  | append: 'tribal and polynesian tattoos|watercolor tattoos|'
-%}

{%- assign product_tags = product.tags | join: '|' | downcase | prepend: '|' | append: '|' -%}
{%- assign product_type = product.type | downcase | strip -%}
{%- assign product_title = product.title
  | downcase
  | replace: '&', ' and '
  | replace: '-', ' '
  | replace: '  ', ' '
  | replace: '  ', ' '
  | strip
  | prepend: '|'
  | append: '|'
-%}

{%- if product_tags contains '|service|' -%}
  true
{%- elsif product_type == 'service' -%}
  true
{%- elsif service_titles contains product_title -%}
  true
{%- else -%}
  false
{%- endif -%}
